Package: bijios-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BijiOS Team <admin@bijios.local>
Depends: xserver-xorg, xinit, openbox, xcompmgr, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter, libgtk-4-1, libvte-2.91-gtk4-0, curl, python3, systemd, xdg-utils, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: bash-completion, network-manager, fonts-noto-color-emoji, policykit-1, pulseaudio | pipewire-audio
Description: BijiOS 1.0.0 (Padi) Full Native Desktop Environment (Pure Rust + GTK4)
 100% Native Rust + GTK4 Linux Desktop Environment for BijiOS v1.0.0 "Padi"
 featuring macOS Golden Gate Liquid Glass UI (Zero Chromium).
 Includes Native Tahoe PAM Login, Top Menu Bar with Dynamic Island, Liquid Glass
 Desktop Widgets & Floating Dock, Finder, Launchpad (.deb App Launcher), WordCraft,
 GridCraft, BijiOS Notes, Calculator, Activity Monitor, System Settings, About BijiOS,
 and TOON v4 Database Daemon.
